# What the installer takes from the ChimeraOS repos, read by it and by update_fedora_extras. "file" paths install from
# the archives to the same place under /; distro extras (polkit policy, http loader, the duplicate session entry) stay
# out. "helper" and "stub" name the Steam client's tools in /usr/bin/steamos-polkit-helpers: a helper runs the
# /usr/bin tool of that name, a stub does nothing.
